=== prefab_beacon_torpedo
" A general Beacon ordnance (Artemis 2.8 lineage). Dropped aft like a mine, it broadcasts
" for a wide radius, is scannable, expires, and is recoverable. ONE native type; the
" specific behaviour (bio attract/repel a monster, and future sensor/comms/decoy kinds) is
" the per-instance PROGRAM carried via the deliver queue and stamped on the object at
" launch. The native round is harmless (damage 0, tiny/brief); the real broadcasting beacon
" object is spawned aft on //launch/missile (see the fabrication addon). Fabricate-only: NO
" build_times, so stations never produce it, and fill_on_spawn false, so a ship carries the
" capacity but spawns with 0 loaded rounds. Capacity is ONE - the tube holds a single beacon,
" so the count IS the program and there is never a queue to get out of order.
metadata: ```
key: Beacon
gui_name: Beacon
sort_order: 6
speed: 3
lifetime: 2
flare_color: #0cf
trail_color: #088
warhead: standard
damage: 0
explosion_size: 1
explosion_color: #0cf
behavior: mine
energy_conversion_value: 100
default_max_count: 1
fill_on_spawn: false
player_ship_roles: tsn
```
    jump prefab_torpedo_type



